  "name": "The Intake and the Sluice-Gates",
  "scene": "The last chamber is a stone race walled in dripping black iron, ending at the double sluice-gates the grey dwarves have winched shut and pinned with drift-spikes. Green ice grows down the walls in ribbed columns, the lamplight stops a few feet short of the standing water, and a slack chain runs from a ring in the floor into the dark behind the intake grate. Every so often the chain comes tight and the whole grate groans.",
